# Defect frames — large raw JPEGs from the drone survey (661 MB total).
# Thumbnails in public/defimages/thumb/ ARE committed (tiny WebP, ~3 KB each).
# To restore the full frames locally: unzip the vendor-supplied zip into public/defimages/.
public/defimages/*.JPG
public/defimages/*.jpg
public/defimages/*.JPEG
public/defimages/*.jpeg
